#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_plot_readout
#! from    10
#! frames  200
#! poster  95
# --check: the plotted values depend on the compiler (on CI's gfortran 14.3, against the recording's 16.2,
# 2 pixel(s) differed by more than 2; measured 2026-11-11): 8 allowed, the threshold unchanged
#! check   max_failed=8
# the pointer enters the plot from the left and sweeps right: the readout follows the nearest iteration; then it leaves
0   move 30 300
10  move 150 200 20
40  move 450 330 50
100 move 760 420 50
160 move 880 500 20
